# Community Admin environment — sanitized example.
# The current placeholder app requires no environment variables and no backend.
# When a feature introduces a key, document it here with a placeholder value
# (never a real value) and describe it in README.md. Public build-time keys
# (NEXT_PUBLIC_*) must be set before `npm run build`.
# Do not copy Amer CRM's or Ability CRM's API URLs, cookie names, or secrets
# into this app; Community Admin uses its own agreed contracts.
